{"id":"0bef16d2888332d0","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-zfc-ordinal2-ordinal-addition.md","title":"ZFC Ordinal2 Ordinal Addition","display":"df-zfc-ordinal2-ordinal-addition — ZFC Ordinal2 Ordinal Addition","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-ordinal2-ordinal-addition","aliases":["58-df-zfc-ordinal2-ordinal-addition"],"display":"df-zfc-ordinal2-ordinal-addition — ZFC Ordinal2 Ordinal Addition","depends_on":["[[58-df-order-type]]","[[58-df-ordinal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-ordinal2-ordinal-addition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-ordinal2-ordinal-addition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-ordinal2-ordinal-addition — ZFC Ordinal2 Ordinal Addition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5d2cd56a38a81b7a\" href=\"?note=5d2cd56a38a81b7a\" title=\"58-df-order-type\">58-df-order-type</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma,S,R\\in V\">\\(\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma,S,R\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a>) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OrderType}_S:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{OrderType}_S:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5d2cd56a38a81b7a\" href=\"?note=5d2cd56a38a81b7a\" title=\"58-df-order-type\">58-df-order-type</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2OrdinalAddition}_S:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2OrdinalAddition}_S:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ordinal2\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}addition}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2OrdinalAddition}_S(\\gamma,\\alpha,\\beta)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\gamma)\n\\land\\exists S,R\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nS=(\\alpha\\times\\{0\\})\\cup(\\beta\\times\\{1\\})\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land R=\\{\\langle\\langle\\xi,i\\rangle,\\langle\\eta,j\\rangle\\rangle\\in S^2:\ni\\in j\\lor(i=j\\land\\xi\\in\\eta)\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{OrderType}_S(\\gamma,S,R)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ordinal2\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}addition}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2OrdinalAddition}_S(\\gamma,\\alpha,\\beta)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\gamma)\n\\land\\exists S,R\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nS=(\\alpha\\times\\{0\\})\\cup(\\beta\\times\\{1\\})\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land R=\\{\\langle\\langle\\xi,i\\rangle,\\langle\\eta,j\\rangle\\rangle\\in S^2:\ni\\in j\\lor(i=j\\land\\xi\\in\\eta)\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{OrderType}_S(\\gamma,S,R)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Ordinal addition is the order type of the explicitly constructed ordered sum.  Both the block order on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> and the within-block ordinal order are written as set membership, so no generic undeclared <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\">\\(&lt;\\)</span> relation is used.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-order-type","status":"resolved","id":"5d2cd56a38a81b7a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-order-type]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\mathsf{Bool}$ (see [[58-df-ordinal]]) and $\\mathrm{OrderType}_S:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}$ (see [[58-df-order-type]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-order-type","status":"resolved","id":"5d2cd56a38a81b7a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\mathsf{Bool}$ (see [[58-df-ordinal]]) and $\\mathrm{OrderType}_S:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}$ (see [[58-df-order-type]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma,S,R\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\mathsf{Bool}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OrderType}_S:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2OrdinalAddition}_S:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ordinal2\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}addition}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2OrdinalAddition}_S(\\gamma,\\alpha,\\beta)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\gamma)\n\\land\\exists S,R\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nS=(\\alpha\\times\\{0\\})\\cup(\\beta\\times\\{1\\})\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land R=\\{\\langle\\langle\\xi,i\\rangle,\\langle\\eta,j\\rangle\\rangle\\in S^2:\ni\\in j\\lor(i=j\\land\\xi\\in\\eta)\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{OrderType}_S(\\gamma,S,R)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"<","display":false}],"bytes":1406,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2995","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-ordinal2-ordinal-addition.md|58-df-zfc-ordinal2-ordinal-addition]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["5d2cd56a38a81b7a","5582a281f15a33c2"]}